n Yarada and Gangavaram Port. The hill is named Dolphin's Nose because it resembles a dolphin's nose. It is a conspicuous land mark in Visakhapatnam. Dolphin's Nose is a huge rocky head land which is 174 meters high and 358 meters above sea level.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Dolphin's Nose","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/RK_Beach_at_Sunset_time_02.JPG/1280px-RK_Beach_at_Sunset_time_02.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/RK_Beach_at_Sunset_time_02.JPG/500px-RK_Beach_at_Sunset_time_02.JPG","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Adityamadhav83","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RK_Beach_at_Sunset_time_02.JPG"}},{"id":"visakhapatnam_tenneti_park","areaId":"visakhapatnam","name":"Tenneti Park","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":17.74794,"lng":83.34991},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"visakhapatnam_tenneti_park","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":9,"commonsNearby":16,"wikiPageviews":99,"wikidataSitelinks":4,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["tennetipark","visakhapatnam"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"Tenneti Park also known as is an urban park in the city of Visakhapatnam. It is a coastal park in the city known for its scenery and recreational amenities. Overlooking the Bay of Bengal, the park has views of the sea with surrounding coastline and the cityscape. Named after Mr.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Tenneti Park","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Tenneti_park_as_seen_from_Kailasagiri_%28May_2019%29.jpg/1280px-Tenneti_park_as_seen_from_Kailasagiri_%28May_2019%29.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Tenneti_park_as_seen_from_Kailasagiri_%28May_2019%29.jpg/500px-Tenneti_park_as_seen_from_Kailasagiri_%28May_2019%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"IM